    "None. PEPEL only proposes a process when its parent is gone and it has shown no CPU activity for %lld minutes of observation. %lld processes have not been observed long enough to judge.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "None. PEPEL only proposes a process when its parent is gone and it has shown no CPU activity for %1$lld minutes of observation. %2$lld processes have not been observed long enough to judge."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Нет. PEPEL предлагает процесс, только если его родитель завершился и процесс не нагружал CPU за время наблюдения (мин: %lld). Процессов, за которыми наблюдали слишком недолго для оценки: %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
