    "One folder per browser build; `playwright install` brings one back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "По папке на каждую сборку браузера; `playwright install` возвращает удалённую."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One folder per unpacked package; uv downloads and unpacks a missing one again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
